{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs4cpNhSWJZatPBQeH8E","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The invoice total now matches the sum of the PDF line items. The full suite passes (5 tests, including 2 new regression tests).\n\n**Root cause:** `invoice_total` in `billing/totals.py` subtracted the unrounded discount amounts from the gross and rounded once at the end. `line_totals`, which the PDF renderer prints, rounds each discounted line to cents first. When a discounted line lands on a half-cent, the two methods disagree. For example, two $0.05 lines at 50% off print as $0.03 each (sum $0.06), but the old total came out to $0.05.\n\n**Fix:** `invoice_total` now sums `line_totals(inv)` and applies tax to that net, so the total is built from the same per-line amounts the PDF shows. The public API is unchanged, and the docstring is updated to match.\n\n**Behavior change to be aware of:** for invoices with discounts, the charged total can now differ by up to a cent from what the old code produced. That is the intended fix, since the customer-facing total should match the printed lines, but if anything downstream stored or reconciled the old totals, it will see those one-cent differences.\n\n**Tests:** I added two regression tests to `tests/test_billing.py`:\n- one with two half-cent discounted lines and no tax;\n- one with the same lines plus 19% tax.\n\nI checked that both fail on the original `totals.py` and pass with the fix.\n\n**Not done:** I did not commit. The `.pyc` files under `billing/__pycache__/` and `tests/__pycache__/` show as modified because they are tracked in git. They should probably be untracked or ignored, but I left that alone."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1969,"cache_read_input_tokens":60822,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1969},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0736ee6-4548-417e-84a4-7c41b270b937","uuid":"5215319b-bdc6-435b-876c-2d4662e0b489","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:32:37.096Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs4cotSEYGWvFzCG1yjj"}
